# Generated figure output. The SCRIPTS are the source of truth and are tracked;
# what they emit is not, for two reasons. It is rebuilt by one command, and — the
# reason that matters — a Fig4.pdf built from the synthetic sweep or from stand-in
# data is indistinguishable by filename from one built from the study slides. Not
# committing them means the copy in this directory is always the one YOU just made
# from the data YOU have mounted.
*.pdf
*.tiff
*.tif
*.png
panels/*.rds
